4. ENTROPY DERIVATIVE CHECK
==========================================================================
  L_H = alpha * E[log pi(a|s)],  a = tanh(y),  y = mu + sigma*u
  hand:  dL_H/dlog_sigma = alpha * [ -1 + 2*sigma^2*E(sech^2(y)) ]
  F := -dL/dlog_sigma  so  F > 0 widens, F < 0 contracts

